title: "Groundhog: agent reliability on medical-evidence tasks"
abstract: >-
  A benchmark of 50 verified medical-evidence tasks measuring whether
  tool-using AI agents succeed consistently across repeated runs (pass^k),
  under injected tool faults, and without unsafe behaviour.
